      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/8/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e\" title=\"123456\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e_2_690x380.jpeg\" alt=\"123456\" data-base62-sha1=\"5OvCqa8xWcmHGHusZQgnt0Yr4DA\" width=\"690\" height=\"380\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e_2_690x380.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e_2_1035x570.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/8/28c08af033fd46938563e72e3120ef209f4f714e_2_1380x760.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5EAEC\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">123456</span><span class=\"informations\">1869×1031 84.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>is there any option to remove header and footer menu in login page at frappe cloud -ERP Next</p>",
