      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/robin_mathai_qzolve\">@robin_mathai_qzolve</a>,</p>\n<p>That for, please go to the <strong>Website Settings</strong> and <em>HTML Header, Robots and Redirects</em> Section.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/3/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/3/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd_2_689x353.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9FyNPuHDRDR1Q9qKCT3MddxWfnv\" width=\"689\" height=\"353\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/3/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd_2_689x353.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/3/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd_2_1033x529.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/3/43c647b5f892aa2fd9385ca8dd8cb97a6c1147cd.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F9\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1293×662 36.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Then apply the style like</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&lt;style&gt;\nnav.navbar.navbar-light.navbar-expand-lg {\n    display: none;\n}\n\nfooter.web-footer {\n    display: none;\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then click on Clear-Cache and reload (Ctrl + Shift + R) and check it.</p>\n<p><strong>Output:</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/7/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2_2_690x350.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5zKWgKaoykl3UynlXf76ljJyLD4\" width=\"690\" height=\"350\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2_2_690x350.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/7/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2_2_1035x525.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/7/27159e76bd21e76ab779c02746e17712caaa53d2.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F4F7\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1303×662 14.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I hope this helps.</p>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
