      "cooked": "<p>Hi</p>\n<p>My login page looks like this;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/1/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/1/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73_2_690x333.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4JLLgDmovhasyjEDquYvPWAwVdF\" width=\"690\" height=\"333\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/1/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73_2_690x333.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/1/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73_2_1035x499.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/1/2135363bef4294bc6525f15bb16a0be60b066a73_2_1380x666.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"C2C8CA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1802×871 110 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and i have customized it by working with custom CSS in website theme;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/a/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a_2_690x325.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3I8RvoV7bOzPeEy93AdL0kTyJgS\" width=\"690\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a_2_690x325.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a_2_1035x487.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/a/1a03f18520975094b50892fb7934f512be8cc72a_2_1380x650.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EAE9E8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1917×903 69.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#page-login</span>{<br>\nbackground: url(/files/premium_photo-1661963899181-3adc0a644f7b.jpg);<br>\nbackground-size: cover;<br>\nbackground-repeat: no-repeat;<br>\nbackground-position: center;<br>\nheight: 100vh;<br>\n}</p>\n<p>.for-login {<br>\nfloat: right;<br>\n}</p>\n<p>/* Adjust the width of the login form <em>/<br>\n.page-card {<br>\nwidth: 100%;<br>\nmax-width: 400px; /</em> Adjust the width as needed */<br>\n// background-color: <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#fff0</span> !important;<br>\n}</p>\n<p>.for-login {<br>\nwidth: 400px;</p>\n<p>}</p>",
